  origin: ['https://yourdomain.com'], // restrict to known origins
  methods: ['GET'],
}));
```

---

## 🟠 Medium Priority — Error Handling

### 5. No Global Error Handler
Unhandled errors will crash the process or leak stack traces to clients.

**Recommendation:** Add a centralized error-handling middleware (must have 4 arguments in Express):

```js
